[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-pwc-graduate-associates-program-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity-127":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},127,"pwc-graduate-associates-program-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity-127","Pwc Graduate Associates Program 2026 For Nigerians: Career Opportunity","\u003Cp>PwC Nigeria is pleased to welcome applications for its 2026 Graduate Associates Program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The PwC Graduate Associates Program offers a career opportunity that includes a competitive salary, hands-on training, leadership skills, mentorship, and professional development.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>PwC Graduate Associates Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: PwC\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Salary\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: April 14, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Details of PwC Graduate Associates Program\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>PwC Graduate Trainee Program is a professional global leadership development framework with the aim of turning potential into a transformative experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The PWC Graduate Associates Program outlines the capabilities that are sought from graduates from associate to partner level – that will help the company thrive as purpose-led and values-driven leaders. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>If you join the PwC Graduate Associates program, you get access to a global network of specialists who will help you to learn, grow, and develop into the accomplished professional you aspire to be.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>PwC Graduate Associates Program Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The PwC Graduate Associates Program offers;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly salary competitive with top companies in Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking opportunities with top professionals\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Professional learning, growth, and development \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How much is the PwC Graduate Trainee Salary?\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The PwC Graduate Trainee Salary is a minimum of ₦400,000 per month for selected candidates.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>What to Expect in the PwC Nigeria Graduate Recruitment Process\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The PwC Graduate Trainee Program will occur in stages, from application to final recruitment. These stages include\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stage 1: Application Period\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stage 2: Cornerstone Assessment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stage 3: SHL Assessments\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stage 4: First-Level Interview\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stage 5: Partner Interview\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stage 6: Offer Stage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stage 7: Resumption\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>PwC Nigeria Graduate Associates Program 2026 Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the PwC Nigeria Graduate Associates Program 2026, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have a bachelor’s degree with a minimum of a second-class upper grade\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have completed the mandatory NYSC program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Possess an O-Level result with a minimum of 5 credits, including English and Mathematics.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>AAPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fpwcng-graduate.erecruit.co\u002Fcandidateapp\u002FJobs\u002FView\u002FPWC260310-3\">https:\u002F\u002Fpwcng-graduate.erecruit.co\u002Fcandidateapp\u002FJobs\u002FView\u002FPWC260310-3\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-10 16:13:45",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fpwc-graduate-associates-program-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity\u002F69d913a9b903c7.29537457_screenshot 2026-04-10 155917.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fpwc-graduate-associates-program-2026-for-nigerians-career-opportunity\u002F69d913a9b903c7.29537457_screenshot%202026-04-10%20155917.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002